<title>GERMANY: German state Bavaria April CPI +1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German state Bavaria April CPI +1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German state of Bavaria said on Thursday that consumer prices in April fell 0.2 percent from March and climbed 1.1 percent from the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>In March prices fell 0.2 percent from February and climbed 1.3 percent from the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
